<Mod id="b049c326-c6f3-4241-a4f6-048c86fae20d" version="9">
  <Properties>
    <Name>UI - Overlay Road And Rail</Name>
    <Teaser>Adds a Roads and Rails entry to the Overlay menu</Teaser>
    <Description>Adds a Roads and Rails entry to the Overlay menu in strategic view that highlights all owned tiles with a road or rail improvement

Hooks into the MiniMap Panel Overlay drop-down via the "Utils - Modular MiniMap Overlays" mod</Description>
    <Authors>William Howard</Authors>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
    <AffectsSavedGames>0</AffectsSavedGames>
